BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Basic Loom Weaving & Beyond: Exploring Two-Shuttle Weaves — Seba
 stopol Center For the Arts\, California
DTSTART:20260924T000000
DTEND:20260925T000000
UID:aa33d888b6ba5481f52abbad06644cf4@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:Out of Stock\n      \n    \n\n\n\n\n\nBasic Loom Weaving & Bey
 ond: Exploring Two-Shuttle Weaves\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n         
  $325.00\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nIn this eight-session class new we
 avers will start at the beginning and experience the full process from des
 igning to finishing. Open to all levels\, participants will dive into weav
 ing a sampler\, or a simple project like a scarf or table runner.Experienc
 ed weavers will explore two-shuttle weaving by setting up a loom for a sam
 pler in either Monks Belt\, Overshot\, Crackle\, or Summer & Winter. Weave
 rs using the “round robin” technique will get a chance to sample the f
